  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I encountered random blue screen crashes—sometimes during the startup splash screen, and other times during gameplay.\n\nStop code: MEMORY_MANAGEMENT (0x1A)\n\nI ran the Windows Memory Diagnostic tool, but it reported no errors detected.\n\nI’ve also tried verifying the integrity of VRChat’s game files.\n\nOS: Windows 11 26120.5742\n\nDevice: i7-13650HX + RTX 4060 Laptop\n\nI’ve attached VRChat logs and Windows blue screen dump files for your reference. Hope they help!\n\nVRChat logs:\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1VtnEJ9h4i9yc8Gh3LYVquY274Z9zI598/view?usp=sharing\n\nWindows blue screen dump:\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1lOzutZpgnjYqs2m_HB-Le0Lm7QduWC0N/view?usp=sharing",
